"""Curated literature annotations for TrustCode Phase 1.

Bibliographic metadata (title, authors, year, venue) is NOT written by hand here:
build_outputs.py fetches it from Crossref (by DOI) or the arXiv API (by id) so that
every reference resolves to an authoritative record.

The annotation fields (objective, method, findings, ...) were written by the
reviewer from the retrieved abstracts (see research/evidence/*.json).
`basis` records what the annotation is based on:
  abstract      - abstract retrieved and read (full text NOT read)
  abstract+page - abstract plus arXiv/publisher landing page summary
  snippet       - only a search-engine snippet was available; MUST read full text
  prior         - classic work annotated from reviewer knowledge; verify against full text
`limitations` are reviewer-assessed from the abstract unless the abstract states them.
"""

